<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>9 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>7 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Les Ferdinand</p>
<p>(Newcastle), Alan Shearer (Newcastle), Matthew Le Tissier</p>
<p>(Southampton)</p>
<p>6 - Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon)</p>
<p>5 - Andy Booth (Sheffield Wednesday), Robbie Earle (Wimbledon),</p>
<p>Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
</text>
